# Critical gates registry

When each gate fires, and where its logic lives (load that file when the gate fires). HARD = a hook enforces it whatever is loaded. Everything else is a reasoning gate: visible result line and default-deny (`agent-behavior.mdc` → Gate visibility).

| Gate | Fires when | Enforcement | Logic lives in |
|---|---|---|---|
| External writes | Any Runlayer write (Jira, Confluence, calendar, Miro, chat) | **HARD:** `beforeMCPExecution` hook (`external-write-gate.py`) asks on any write verb; reads pass; email denied | `agent-behavior.mdc` Safety |
| Jira story preflight | A Story is about to be created in Jira | **HARD:** the same hook reruns 5 structural checks; fail = BA override. A pass is not the DoR | `_workstream/dor-check.py`, `ba-story-writing` 3b |
| Shared-repo leak guard | A file under `paths.sharedRepoRoot` (or `BA_SHARED_REPO_ROOT`) is edited / committed | **HARD when a shared-repo path is set:** edits warn, git commit/push with leaks is denied. No path set = no guard | `dev-handover-format.md §1, §7` |
| Miro pre-flight | Before Miro `layout_create` | Manual: write a fresh plan file with `## Board inventory (context_explore)` and `## Board placement` first | `miro-board-analysis/algorithm.md` Pass 2b-0/2b |
| Handover readiness | `/handover`, before any publish | Reasoning, default-deny | `ba-dev-handover` Tasks 3–4 |
| Interrogate before confirming | A requirement leaves `proposed` or feeds stories or handover | Reasoning | `ba-requirements-interrogator` (HK-DISC-INT-pre-register) |
| Ground before scoring | A confidence score / priority / risk rating is about to be locked in | Reasoning | `ba-data-investigation` (HK-*-BDI-* hooks) |
| Pre-publish state validation | Before `/publish-status` or any Confluence publish | Reasoning (full mode) | `ba-state-validator` |
| Workstream exit gates | A workstream is about to be marked complete for a scope | Reasoning | That workstream skill's exit check |
| Unpromoted-state reminder | End of response / pre-compaction | Stop-hook nudge only if `stopFollowup: true`; pre-compaction snapshot always | `references/sync-procedures.md` |
| Nested PowerShell | Shell runs nested `powershell -Command` with `$variables` | Manual: follow the shell-safety guidance | `references/workspace-operations.md` (Shell safety) |
| Register scope format | Writing Scope In/Out on `requirements-register.md` | Reasoning | `requirements-register-unified-template.md` §2a |
| Edit of interrogated/confirmed register section | Editing a section whose parent `status` is `interrogated` or `confirmed` | Reasoning, default-deny | `requirements-register-unified-template.md` §2b, `ba-requirements-interrogator` Step 4 |

A hook denial is never argued with; fix the cause. This table changes only with a matching update to `hook-contracts.md`.
